{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1483081-deed-names-are-they-still-a-thing","id":1483081,"title":"Deed Names. Are they still a thing?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-04T15:55:23-07:00","id":1483081,"title":"Deed Names. Are they still a thing?","content":"Are Deed Names still a thing in 2nd edition Forsaken? Or do werewolves just go by their given human names?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10179-shadryx","name":"shadryx","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-04T16:35:17-07:00","id":1483084,"title":"","content":"Yes, they're absolutely still a thing. Werewolves still inhabit a setting where names have occult power and Renown is a common pursuit among the tribes.<br /> <br /> It's just that they also inhabit a setting where every Cahalith and Iron Master with a dot of Honor has affinity for a Gift whose Facets include &quot;find out every name this person is known to another person by&quot; as the basic success outcome for a roll that's only resisted by the Anonymity Merit, so plenty of werewolves either haven't done something that has translated cleanly to a callsign or urban-legend nickname or are going for having their mortal names are known labels for People Not To Fuck With, if they haven't committed to full-time hunting, faked their death, and started living off the grid.<br /> <br /> The likes of Tox Never-Speaks and such are still around \u2014 Saber and Blood-Smiles-on-the-Knife are mentioned in fiction in The Pack, and Night Horrors: Shunned by the Moon contains Cyrus Silver-Scarred, Tejumola Tide-Breaker and Mimi Moon-Shunned. It's not <i>de rigeur</i>, but it never has been.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}